{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫台慶劇《璀璨之城》在15日播出的劇情中，由陳瀅飾演的記者霍佩樺（Sarah），為了與官孝賢（張智霖飾）達成合作，當眾解開襯衫並脫下外衣和牛仔褲，最後只穿黑色喱士內衣褲對鏡頭，展現完美身段。</p><figure><img alt=\"陳瀅寬衣解帶。（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524344595877888695314.jpeg/EQ008HyLLeYxNwDtOrn-A3fwtu_GjKZZzavxds2r8XY\"/><figcaption>陳瀅寬衣解帶。（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>通訊局證實接獲28宗投訴</p><p>劇集播出後，由於演出尺度過於大膽，不少家長擔心小朋友極有可能看到相關情節，亦有少網民認為場面過火，甚至揚言要向監管機構投訴。對此，通訊事務管理局（通訊局）16日回覆傳媒查詢時證實，截至16日為止，共接獲28宗相關劇集的投訴，當中高達25宗均針對15日播出的最新一集。投訴內容主要圍繞劇中情節尺度過大及不適宜播放等問題。</p><figure><img alt=\"褪去衣衫。（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524342234353664194273.jpeg/mHwRUKL4qPl181KHQ3exJx5IIjiejphnzx84Sc8fOEk\"/><figcaption>褪去衣衫。（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"褲都除埋。（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524349365063680059832.jpeg/coM-mfdMowyRYBr3Tdqal-3Vw4p58KISFmYobhZmKG4\"/><figcaption>褲都除埋。（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>當局按程序審視有否違規</p><p>通訊局發言人表示，目前正按照既定程序處理有關投訴，會進一步審視相關集數內容是否違規。今次陳瀅突破框框的演出雖然成功掀起話題與爆點，但也意外引發觀眾對於電視黃金時段播出劇集尺度的討論與爭議。</p><figure><img alt=\"褲都除埋。（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524339780554752895604.jpeg/NeisbD5cFVFP443rjh7arQisGkkiKyj79R0xlPUdMZQ\"/><figcaption>褲都除埋。（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"以為完？仲有！（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524347204866048956012.jpeg/DoduTd5KqtdkJ_ILde9v-deV7mR-DaZNbgFJqG4BSag\"/><figcaption>以為完？仲有！（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"唔止呀！仲有！（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524344579100672953086.jpeg/CT-n7QyrtMhZ6MtRAZgeqka40_43vCo6WHL53lhy-d4\"/><figcaption>唔止呀！仲有！（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"連Bra都除埋。（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188120398084968448410376.jpeg/KDn5FjcuJussU0rWEoBAd3Da4Akm9rVJCgEjvAoBI7w\"/><figcaption>連Bra都除埋。（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"被Chilam推開雙腿拍照。（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188120601043144704109537.jpeg/gGkJ7DiHn2pyt1HfLTLWTtCk7-orIpC81VQ2kNVUNpA\"/><figcaption>被Chilam推開雙腿拍照。（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T08:19:41.431850+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":490,"images":8,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T08:00:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T08:17:36.781758+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T08:17:36.781758+00:00","content_hash":"8e4908b501b08e73ce90a01d1aec6a070b5c319f1085193c39234bd4a337d021","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}